   REGION               GROUND  HELD BY  YOUR UNITS        WOPR'S UNITS
 1 ALEXANDRIA           CITY    YOU      ART1              
 2 EL ALAMEIN           ROUGH   YOU      ARM1 ARM2 INF1    
