 4 SIDI BARRANI         OPEN    -                          
 5 SOLLUM               ROUGH   -                          
 6 TOBRUK               CITY    WOPR                       ARM1 ARM2 INF1
 7 BENGHAZI             CITY    WOPR                       ART1
